From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BDK Patches <patches@bdk.invalid>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 16:46:09 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] bdk: export the BDK engine's services test hook from the
 framework

The engine's services have test hooks that the conformance suite and the engine scenario tests need: reading a Chromium preference or content setting of a profile and capturing a page to a PNG or PDF file. They sit behind one function, bdk_testing_services (//bdk/engine/bdk_testing.h in the BDK repository), so that the export list needs one name for all of them. Like the other test hooks it is not the C ABI and gives a page nothing: it acts as the application, on its own runtime.

List it in chrome/app/framework.exports and in framework.order.

Used by: packages/core/tests/harness_engine.mm and the engine scenario tests in the BDK repository.
---
 chrome/app/framework.exports | 1 +
 chrome/app/framework.order   | 1 +
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/chrome/app/framework.exports b/chrome/app/framework.exports
index 93a5fc01549ced7a9adb13ba51d3345503a750fc..01ab5da57584e4b469cbeab2a6e6255476e74fdc 100644
--- a/chrome/app/framework.exports
+++ b/chrome/app/framework.exports
@@ -112,6 +112,7 @@ _bdk_testing_pending_work
 _bdk_testing_raise_ui_request
 _bdk_testing_run_for
 _bdk_testing_script_navigation
+_bdk_testing_services
 _bdk_testing_simulate_key
 _bdk_testing_tab_info
 _bdk_testing_withdraw_ui_requests
diff --git a/chrome/app/framework.order b/chrome/app/framework.order
index 2f0b6339615bd6615b38881c9aff237d28a28af1..e01b52886147c5c6bb690737bb421e31e569e184 100644
--- a/chrome/app/framework.order
+++ b/chrome/app/framework.order
@@ -120,6 +120,7 @@ _bdk_testing_pending_work
 _bdk_testing_raise_ui_request
 _bdk_testing_run_for
 _bdk_testing_script_navigation
+_bdk_testing_services
 _bdk_testing_simulate_key
 _bdk_testing_tab_info
 _bdk_testing_withdraw_ui_requests
